    "title": "Switzerland Picks 57 Countries for Crypto Tax Data Sharing Starting in 2028",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/switzerland-57-countries-crypto-tax",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Switzerland-Picks-57-Countries-for-Crypto-Tax-Data-Sharing-Starting-in-2028.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/switzerland-57-countries-crypto-tax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Switzerland Picks 57 Countries for Crypto Tax Data Sharing Starting in 2028</a></p>\n<p>Switzerland approved 57 partner jurisdictions, including all EU states and the UK, for automatic crypto tax data exchanges under the OECD's CARF from 2028.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/switzerland-57-countries-crypto-tax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Switzerland Picks 57 Countries for Crypto Tax Data Sharing Starting in 2028</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Switzerland-Picks-57-Countries-for-Crypto-Tax-Data-Sharing-Starting-in-2028.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/switzerland-57-countries-crypto-tax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Switzerland Picks 57 Countries for Crypto Tax Data Sharing Starting in 2028</a></p>\n<p>Switzerland approved 57 partner jurisdictions, including all EU states and the UK, for automatic crypto tax data exchanges under the OECD's CARF from 2028.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/switzerland-57-countries-crypto-tax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Switzerland Picks 57 Countries for Crypto Tax Data Sharing Starting in 2028</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
