    "title": "Bithumb Says October Hack Exposed Passports, Bank Accounts and Wallet Addresses",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/bithumb-hack-exposed-passports-wallet-addresses",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Bithumb-Seeks-Asset-Freeze-to-Recover-Bitcoin-From-40-Billion-Payout-Error.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/bithumb-hack-exposed-passports-wallet-addresses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bithumb Says October Hack Exposed Passports, Bank Accounts and Wallet Addresses</a></p>\n<p>Bithumb said a follow-up review found its October breach exposed more people and data, including passports and wallet addresses, and lasted about 15 days.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/bithumb-hack-exposed-passports-wallet-addresses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bithumb Says October Hack Exposed Passports, Bank Accounts and Wallet Addresses</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Bithumb-Seeks-Asset-Freeze-to-Recover-Bitcoin-From-40-Billion-Payout-Error.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/bithumb-hack-exposed-passports-wallet-addresses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bithumb Says October Hack Exposed Passports, Bank Accounts and Wallet Addresses</a></p>\n<p>Bithumb said a follow-up review found its October breach exposed more people and data, including passports and wallet addresses, and lasted about 15 days.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/bithumb-hack-exposed-passports-wallet-addresses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bithumb Says October Hack Exposed Passports, Bank Accounts and Wallet Addresses</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
